# 止蝕
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:防止金屬表面生鏽，令佢唔會腐爛嘅方法或物質（量詞：種、個）
eng:anti-rust / rust prevention
<eg>
yue:呢把螺絲要上止蝕，唔然會好快生鏽。 (goi1 pae3 lo4 si1 jiu3 jiu1 soeng5 zi6 sik6, m4 jin4 wui5 hou2 faai3 saang1 san1.)
eng:This screw needs anti-rust treatment, otherwise it will rust very quickly.

yue:車底嘅止蝕漆好重要，唔然雨水咁多會令車底腐。 (ce1 dai2 ge3 zi6 sik6 man4 hou2 zung1 jiu3, m4 jin4 jyu5 seoi2 seoi5 gei2 do1 wui5 zai2 ce1 dai2 fat6.)
eng:Anti-rust paint on the undercarriage is important; otherwise all the rain will make the undercarriage rot. [end of text]


